 ## Background
-VolSDF Volume Rendering builds on the principles of VolSDF (Volume SDF), which uses SDFs for volume rendering [S1, unofficial]. The method is also related to HybridNeRF, which introduces adaptive surfaceness finetuning [S3]. SDF-based voxel rendering is a simpler, non-differentiable approach demonstrated in holographic_fractals [S2, unofficial].
